ithout speaking a single syllable."},{"id":"reason-5","number":5,"short":"My future is complete only with you","detail":"Every dream I envision, every milestone I aspire to reach, only holds meaning if your hand is clasped tightly in mine."},{"id":"reason-6","number":6,"short":"You are my Mikrokosmos","detail":"In an endless cosmos of seven billion stars, your light is the one I will spend this lifetime, and every universe after, loving."}],"resonanceFrequencies":[{"frequency":432,"tag":"THE MAGIC SHOP","title":"Where It All Began","date":"Spring Resonance","reflection":"The gentle vibration of finding home in an unfamiliar world."},{"frequency":528,"tag":"SERENDIPITY","title":"Pure Synchronicity","date":"Summer Twilight","reflection":"How all the unexplainable coincidences turned into our greatest love story."},{"frequency":639,"tag":"BORAHAE VOW","title":"Harmonic Forever","date":"This Moment","reflection":"Two distinct melodies uniting into one everlasting purple symphony."}],"pillars":[{"id":"pillar-1","title":"Unconditional Sanctuary","koreanTag":"안식처","description":"A home where your heart is always safe, accepted, and cherished without measure."},{"id":"pillar-2","title":"Wild Exploration","koreanTag":"모험","description":"Hands intertwined through every city, sunrise, continent, and dream we chase together."},{"id":"pillar-3","title":"Eternal Patience","koreanTag":"인내","description":"Through winter rains and quiet seasons, holding you close through every shift of time."},{"id":"pillar-4","title":"Shared Laughter","koreanTag":"미소","description":"Filling our days with silly dances, midnight snacks, and boundless joy that never fades."}],"proposalQuestion":"Will you spend this lifetime, and every universe after, with me?","celebrationTitle":"Together in Our Mikrokosmos","celebrationMessage":"You are my beginning, my present, and all my tomorrows. I purple you, forever and always.","whatsappPhone":"15551234567","letterLines":["In a universe of seven billion people